<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">22072026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Shelling in Gaza City's Zeitoun neighbourhood killed three civilians on Kashko Street as Israel pushed its troops past the ceasefire's yellow line.</s> <s>October's truce had capped Israeli control at fifty-three percent of Gaza, yet nearly seventy more people fled airstrikes in Deir al-Balah this week.</s> <s>Whether a line drawn on a map still means anything is the question dozens of displaced families are now living.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Ukraine has a new commander-in-chief, as forty-three-year-old Mykhailo Drapatyi takes charge of its armed forces.</s> <s>Zelensky replaced sixty-year-old Oleksandr Syrskyi after street protests and a government reshuffle, not a battlefield collapse — the biggest military shake-up of the entire war.</s> <s>A wartime leadership answering to public anger and mounting casualties is a rare thing, and the sacked reformist minister Mykhailo Fedorov still wants his old job back.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>China ran a live-fire drill this week near Okinotorishima, a speck of coral that Japan calls an island and Beijing calls a rock.</s> <s>Under the UN Convention on the Law of the Sea, an island grants a two-hundred-nautical-mile economic zone... a rock grants nothing at all.</s> <s>So a drill near a reef is really an argument over who owns the sea, sharpened by deepening China-Russia naval coordination.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Ismael Zambada García, the man they call El Mayo, was sentenced to life without parole and ordered to forfeit fifteen billion dollars in drug profits.</s> <s>He ran Mexico's Sinaloa Cartel for four decades by avoiding spectacle and embedding himself deep in the state's economy and politics.</s> <s>His capture came by trickery, lured onto a US-bound flight in twenty twenty-four, yet his son is already seen as the heir.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Six ships have already turned back after Yemen's Houthis banned all shipping to Saudi Arabia through the Bab al-Mandeb strait.</s> <s>That narrow gate at the Red Sea's mouth carries the oil that must flow once the Strait of Hormuz is closed.</s> <s>Yemen's government wants its allies to treat the Houthis as one node in a wider Iran-linked network.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A Cairo terrorism court postponed the trial of the former Ultras leader Sayed Moshagheb, rearrested only hours after his release.</s> <s>His alleged crimes... fireworks and unlawful assembly at a party celebrating his own homecoming, after nearly eleven years inside.</s> <s>When a terrorism circuit prosecutes a welcome-home gathering, rights groups say, re-jailing freed dissidents by paperwork becomes routine.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Mahmudah, just sixteen, vanished when the boat carrying her to a stranger's marriage capsized in the Andaman Sea.</s> <s>Brokers sell stateless Rohingya girls to overseas grooms for cash, and without citizenship a broker's word replaces any marriage licence or police recourse.</s> <s>As aid to the camps is cut, more desperate families accept, feeding the very route that drowned her.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Abderrahim Fakir cried "aiuto, basta" — help, enough — as officers pinned him to the ground in Bologna.</s> <s>The forty-two-year-old Moroccan-born man died during a psychiatric episode, and by Monday night the Italian city was burning.</s> <s>Italy has no independent body to investigate deaths in custody, and Prime Minister Meloni condemned the protesters rather than name the dead.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Nine in ten American prescriptions are for generic drugs, and Donald Trump plans to tariff those cheap medicines at one hundred percent.</s> <s>Seventy percent are imported, much of it from India, whose thin-margin factories can't absorb a tariff and have no US replacement to reshore to.</s> <s>The duties climb to one hundred percent in twenty twenty-eight, then two hundred a year later — punishing patients long before a single plant ever moves.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Six hundred and forty-five million people faced hunger last year, fourteen million fewer than the year before.</s> <s>But that global improvement hides a sharp divergence... Africa's three hundred and nine million hungry keep rising with population, even as Asia and Latin America recover.</s> <s>The worst catastrophic hunger anywhere on Earth remains in Gaza, where UN agencies now count six hundred and forty thousand people.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Canada faces its fourth tariff deadline as Trump threatens fifty percent duties on twenty billion dollars of its goods.</s> <s>It already pays fifteen to fifty percent on steel and lumber, and the US alone refused to renew the North American trade pact.</s> <s>Prime Minister Carney agreed to intensify talks with no deadline set, leaving the continent's trade under permanent annual review.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The war with Iran will cost the United States thirty-seven and a half billion dollars by the end of September.</s> <s>Defence Secretary Pete Hegseth told senators the bill rose seven and a half billion in mere weeks, with twenty-one billion more needed to replace spent munitions.</s> <s>Stockpiles will take years to rebuild, and that, not politics, is the real limit on how long such a campaign can run.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>In a cave in GunaiKurnai country, people burned grass for healing and cursing rituals for twenty-five thousand years without a break.</s> <s>Burnt-grass residues layered in the soil match nineteenth-century records and the nation's own oral traditions across hundreds of generations.</s> <s>With GunaiKurnai custodians co-directing the dig in Australia, one of the longest known cultural continuities on Earth also vindicates oral memory as reliable history.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Brussels has quietly proposed letting companies keep their free carbon permits for longer.</s> <s>The European Commission would shrink the Emissions Trading System's allowance supply more slowly after twenty thirty-one, permitting more emissions without touching any headline target.</s> <s>Member states now negotiate the plan, a reminder that climate ambition erodes in the fine print far more often than in the speeches.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Poland is paying six hundred and fifty-six million euros for twelve satellites in Europe's IRIS2 constellation.</s> <s>The network is Europe's answer to depending on Starlink, a private US system, after the war in Ukraine laid bare how deep that reliance ran.</s> <s>A front-line state buying its own orbital slots is buying communication it never has to ask permission to use.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>"If someone is under fifteen, the account will be closed" — France has passed the EU's first blanket social media ban for children under fifteen.</s> <s>Enforcing it means proving the age of everyone, so a rule aimed at children quietly reaches into every adult's privacy too.</s> <s>The Constitutional Council must rule before September's rollout, as other European capitals watch, ready to copy it or reject it.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>